  unitName: Eir (EU)
  unitId: 730113
  unitNumber: 7026
  description: Part of the pantheon of fierce warriors coming from the coldest territories
    of Grand Gaia. Their legend tells us that 6 exceptional semi-goddesses select
    among the best of dying combatants, whom would be granted the right to enter
    their heaven and fight side by side with the gods. Eir is the kindest of all.
    She'd rather heal than kill when she can. Dying warriors crossing vast woods
    have been seen completely healed after their journey; some of whom were missing
    an entire limb!
  summonDesc: From the ground to the sky, I will protect you.
  fusionDesc: Give me strength, for those in need.
